      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the default value can change without changing the flag interface, and so that callers can set it explicitly regardless of current default.\n\nCould do that via separate --i2c-mux and --no-i2c-mux options.  Or however you prefer.  I don\u0027t have much of a preference.  I suggested this form to match -W / --send-waveform, which is the only other boolean option that can be configured either way currently.\n\nIf this is changed to --i2c-mux + --no-i2c-mux, or some other form, please update -W / --send-waveform to match.",
